WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:04.440
We do have, I guess, what we're calling good
news regarding the Johnson and Johnson vaccine.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:09.960
Dr. Anthony Fauci says that he believes the
U.S. is going to resume use of the Johnson

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:16.090
and Johnson vaccine for coronavirus by the
end of the week, maybe with some kind of warning

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:17.970
or restriction attached.

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:23.990
You might remember we covered last Tuesday
that regulators said temporarily pause use

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:27.100
of the single dose Johnson and Johnson vaccine.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:35.149
There were six cases of rare brain blood clots,
all in women age 18 to 48.

00:00:35.149 --> 00:00:38.719
I believe as of right now that one of those
women died.

00:00:38.719 --> 00:00:43.840
This is out of about seven million Johnson
and Johnson vaccine doses that were given.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:49.940
And Dr. Fauci says he's expecting a decision
on that vaccine maybe by this Friday, and

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:55.270
that the most likely outcome, he seems confident
that there will be a resumption of the use

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:57.710
of that vaccine.

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:06.810
You will again remember that this was within
13 days of receiving the shot women age 18

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:09.929
to 48 who developed these symptoms.

00:01:09.929 --> 00:01:15.810
The FDA decided to put a pause out of, quote,
an abundance of caution.

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:21.060
And unfortunately, you know, this is one of
those things that what's tough about it is

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:29.340
that it will create certainly some additional
anti VAX sentiment and provide fuel for the

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:34.270
anti vaccine crowd, even if it is not warranted.

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:36.749
And it's one of these things where you really
have to think of the numbers.

00:01:36.749 --> 00:01:40.770
Big picture, that vaccine has been given to
more than seven million people.

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:47.829
There have been six or seven blood clots reported
and one of those people died.

00:01:47.829 --> 00:01:53.079
And when you first of all, when you compare
that to the death rate of getting the virus

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:57.919
itself, that's important context to have and
to provide.

00:01:57.919 --> 00:02:05.109
The other reality is, you know, if if you
wanted to be really careful with this and

00:02:05.109 --> 00:02:09.829
this is, I think, what Dr. Fauci is kind of
alluding to or maybe what's being considered

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:13.819
by regulators, it was all women, 18 to 48.

00:02:13.819 --> 00:02:19.390
What if you say, well, maybe you don't give
this vaccine to women 18 to 48?

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:26.060
The other factor, and I mentioned this last
week and there's some early suggestions, but

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:33.680
it's still being investigated that there may
be a medicine interaction that is common to

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:38.370
the individuals that experience this, the
six or seven women that experience the blood

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:39.580
clotting.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:44.290
If it were determined that there's a specific
interaction between a medication that these

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:49.470
women were on and the vaccine, that would
even be further reassuring, you could figure

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:53.969
out exactly who it is that should not receive
this vaccine.

00:02:53.969 --> 00:02:57.569
And that's something that is increasingly
being looked at.

00:02:57.569 --> 00:03:01.629
There was a bit of a slowdown over the weekend
in terms of vaccine doses.

00:03:01.629 --> 00:03:06.470
And in fact, I'm pulling up the numbers myself,
although it's not clear that it's related

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:09.209
to the Johnson and Johnson decision.

00:03:09.209 --> 00:03:13.270
If you look at the numbers from over the weekend,
there was a bit of a slowdown in the number

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:20.499
of doses given there are reports that this
may be because of what's called demand slackening

00:03:20.499 --> 00:03:21.499
a little bit.

00:03:21.499 --> 00:03:23.040
There was just a little bit of a downturn.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:27.579
If you go back to about April 11th and look
at the last eight days, the average number

00:03:27.579 --> 00:03:29.329
of doses has gone down.

00:03:29.329 --> 00:03:33.300
Now, part of it reasonably would be because
of the JNJ pause.

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:38.790
But there are reports that some states, states
where there's less interest in the vaccine,

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:44.569
places like the example we've been looking
at is Mississippi, where we may actually be

00:03:44.569 --> 00:03:49.980
at the point where there is more supply and
ability to give the vaccine than there is

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:50.980
demand.

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:56.459
And what's going to have to be figured out
is will vaccine start to be shifted from states

00:03:56.459 --> 00:04:01.430
where there is less demand to states where
there is more demand of, I believe, Vermont

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:06.739
and Massachusetts, both at the top with 92
percent of the population wanting the vaccine?

00:04:06.739 --> 00:04:07.859
Is that even possible?

00:04:07.859 --> 00:04:11.560
Is it a recipe for disaster starting to move
vaccines around instead?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:16.549
Will will the focus be just on a campaign
to make people want the vaccine?

00:04:16.549 --> 00:04:22.180
Yesterday, we saw Joe Biden and Barack Obama
participate in an event talking about the

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:23.270
vaccine, encouraging people to get it.

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:28.690
I don't know the answer, but it seems as though
today, which is the day where everybody becomes

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:32.970
eligible, we are starting to see a slackening
of demand.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:38.800
Hopefully full eligibility starting today
will bring a bunch of new demand and maybe

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:42.110
we can get up to even four million doses a
day.

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:43.530
Remains to be seen.

00:04:43.530 --> 00:05:47.570
JNJ, though, expected to come back online,
possibly as soon as Friday.

